## Build integrity

Each release is packaged once by the Author and published on the Chrome Web
Store and as a release asset in this repository. To check that a copy you
received is authentic, install it from the Chrome Web Store (which serves the
Author's uploaded package), or compare its SHA-256 checksum with the checksum
published alongside the corresponding GitHub release. The extension loads no
remotely hosted code.
